{# ============================================================================
   MUHARRIK · DEMO PRODUCTS  (shared stand-in catalogue)
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Sixteen car-accessory products with their own pictures (assets/mh-p01.jpg …
   mh-p16.jpg, 800×800), bilingual names, realistic EGP prices, a few
   compare-at prices and a few low quantities so the stock LED has something to
   say. Shown by the selling widgets while the merchant has picked nothing —
   see `use_demo` in pit-lane / deal-spotlight.

   The order is fixed (01 … 16) so widgets can refer to an item by index:
     01 Snow Foam Shampoo 1L        05 Leather Seat Covers    09 LED Headlight Bulbs H7   13 OBD2 Scanner
     02 Ceramic Coating Kit         06 Car Vacuum Cleaner     10 Ambient Interior Light   14 Portable Tyre Inflator
     03 Microfibre Towel Pack ×6    07 Wiper Blades Pair      11 4K Dash Cam              15 Alloy Wheel Cleaner
     04 Premium Floor Mats          08 All-Weather Car Cover  12 Wireless Charger Mount   16 Tyre Shine Gel

   A `{% ui %}` include renders — a `set` inside it does not reach the caller —
   so this file RENDERS the set in one of three modes:

     mode='cards' (default)  hx-card.njk for items [from, from+count), each one
                             `demo='on'` (links to /shop, no buy buttons).
                               wrap='class'   wraps every card in <div class>
                               number='on'    …and stamps data-n="01" on it
                               sale_badge / low_badge / note / rating / stock
                               pass straight through to the card.
     mode='json'             the array as JSON (for a <script type=application/json>).
     mode='item'             ONE field of ONE item as text:
                               index=1 field='title' | 'price' | 'was' | 'img'
                               | 'qty' | 'rating' | 'reviews' | 'cat' | 'slug'

   Usage:
     {% ui "mh-demo-products.njk", from=0, count=12, wrap='mh-pl-item', number='on',
           sale_badge=saleBadge, low_badge=lowBadge, rating='on', stock='on' %}
   ========================================================================= #}

